    "description": "Add a Name input field to the new Operator creation flow. Users cannot input the Operator name today when they create a new record.\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n* Add a Name field to the new Operator quick-create or record creation flow.\n\n* Make the Name field visible and required at creation time.\n\n## Notes\n\n* Flagged as a companion ask in BUILD-264, not built there. This ticket closes that gap.\n\n* The same ask was built for Partner in BUILD-267. Use the same approach here.\n\n## Source\n\nEmily Vandenberg, Wagertech feedback — Operator & Partner Record Pages doc, WAGERTECH Feedback OPERATOR section: \"When Creating a NEW Operator you need a field to INPUT NAME.\"",
